{"code":2000,"codename":"Koyuki","data":{"id":8,"skin":"","skin_jp":"","skin_cn":"","skin_zh_tw":"","skin_list":[{"id":8,"avatar":"//static.kivo.wiki/images/students/%E7%A9%BA%E4%BA%95%E5%92%B2/avatar.png","skin":"","skin_cn":""},{"id":279,"avatar":"//static.kivo.wiki/images/students/%E7%A9%BA%E4%BA%95%20%E5%92%B2/%E6%B3%B3%E8%A3%85/avatar.png","skin":"泳装","skin_cn":"泳装"}],"family_name":"空井","given_name":"咲","family_name_jp":"空井","given_name_jp":"サキ","family_name_kr":"소라이","given_name_kr":"사키","family_name_en":"Sorai","given_name_en":"Saki","family_name_zh_tw":"空井","given_name_zh_tw":"咲希","family_name_cn":"空井","given_name_cn":"咲","nick_name":"","momo_talk_signature":"行动胜于雄辩","main_relation":44,"relation":[43,70],"age":15,"grade":"一年生","height":161,"birthday":"04-09","hobby":"枪支整备、采集植物","designer":"YutokaMizu","illustrator":"YutokaMizu","character_voice":"友永朱音","character_voice_cn":"耗纸","release_date":"2022-03-23","release_date_cn":"2024-04-04","release_date_global":"2022-11-08","school":11,"weapon_type":"MG","is_install":true,"is_install_cn":true,"is_install_global":true,"is_npc":false,"show_list":true,"body_shape":"Large","special_appearance":false,"spine":[416,138,184],"model":[51,256],"voice":[{"description":"CH0144_Title","category":"lobby","text":"蔚蓝档案","text_original":"ブルーアーカイブ。","file":"//static.kivo.wiki/voices/students/%E7%A9%BA%E4%BA%95%20%E5%92%B2/PzPp5LX0E4wDZqhzYghLgJaULtYvliAX.ogg"},{"description":"CH0144_Cafe_monolog_1","category":"cafe","text":"哈啊，一个个都这么松懈……真是可悲。","text_original":"どいつもこいつも気が緩みっぱなし……情けない。","file":"//static.kivo.wiki/voices/students/%E7%A9%BA%E4%BA%95%20%E5%92%B2/iWsPWYE1F2zRxGDUdoMWoNE2nApR18rj.ogg"},{"description":"CH0144_Cafe_monolog_2","category":"cafe","text":"到哪儿都能碰见傻子。","text_original":"見渡す限りアホ面ばっかりだ。","file":"//static.kivo.wiki/voices/students/%E7%A9%BA%E4%BA%95%20%E5%92%B2/txQpHQxkcq0BGXXexkJ99omxXJ3zIVQJ.ogg"},{"description":"CH0144_Cafe_monolog_3","category":"cafe","text":"就算现在是休息时间，也要保持最起码的纪律……","text_original":"いくら休憩中とは言え、最低限の軍規というものがだな……。","file":"//static.kivo.wiki/voices/students/%E7%A9%BA%E4%BA%95%20%E5%92%B2/eT06bNdRw7DHPWLFyziTdpCqB5Ypklgf.ogg"},{"description":"CH0144_Cafe_monolog_4","category":"cafe","text":"（这个东西的教学手册在哪里啊……？）","text_original":"（これを使うためのマニュアルはどこに……？）","file":"//static.kivo.wiki/voices/students/%E7%A9%BA%E4%BA%95%20%E5%92%B2/nxejZ0tn1xpn2WcFgRmRsRILWIPZqpqT.ogg"},{"description":"CH0144_Cafe_monolog_5","category":"cafe","text":"（那是什么。在教学手册上也没看到过啊……）","text_original":"（何だあれ、教範でも見たことない……）","file":"//static.kivo.wiki/voices/students/%E7%A9%BA%E4%BA%95%20%E5%92%B2/JhjDVazugXxsh3Ld3dizROxamLx3GU8r.ogg"},{"description":"CH0144_CommonSkill","category":"battle","text":"这个会有点痛啊！","text_original":"これは痛いぞ！","file":"//static.kivo.wiki/voices/students/%E7%A9%BA%E4%BA%95%20%E5%92%B2/yihAffYXJUGqISZkQOrnuLDBM8bgzyYF.ogg"},{"description":"CH0144_ExSkill_1","category":"battle","text":"RABBIT 2，降落准备完毕。","text_original":"RABBIT2、降下準備完了。","file":"//static.kivo.wiki/voices/students/%E7%A9%BA%E4%BA%95%20%E5%92%B2/bgqqbL1h7zdXywsy9z8TlHo2o8O9RPp8.ogg"},{"description":"CH0144_ExSkill_2","category":"battle","text":"安全带，准备完毕。","text_original":"ハーネスの準備完了。","file":"//static.kivo.wiki/voices/students/%E7%A9%BA%E4%BA%95%20%E5%92%B2/2aloet3wDUG75kbc56Dc9VJxrS2t32zm.ogg"},{"description":"CH0144_ExSkill_3","category":"battle","text":"RABBIT 2，已到达现场。","text_original":"RABBIT2、現場に到着した。","file":"//static.kivo.wiki/voices/students/%E7%A9%BA%E4%BA%95%20%E5%92%B2/BQiABgkE4DWKzHeSzlPjV2RbyInNsoN4.ogg"},{"description":"CH0144_ExSkill_Level_1","category":"battle","text":"开始掩护射击！","text_original":"援護射撃、開始。","file":"//static.kivo.wiki/voices/students/%E7%A9%BA%E4%BA%95%20%E5%92%B2/i0mXaIwxlKQzzMlMZpJP80wQftTrLxyV.ogg"},{"description":"CH0144_ExSkill_Level_2","category":"battle","text":"开始火力支援。","text_original":"火力支援を始める！","file":"//static.kivo.wiki/voices/students/%E7%A9%BA%E4%BA%95%20%E5%92%B2/osIhVlsZ2TvUmctUDt8qWs0O29oEnzuk.ogg"},{"description":"CH0144_ExSkill_Level_3","category":"battle","text":"不要小瞧SRT的力量。","text_original":"SRTの力、甘く見るなよ！","file":"//static.kivo.wiki/voices/students/%E7%A9%BA%E4%BA%95%20%E5%92%B2/R9pt3rret7DKMoiPz3LQWEK5mg9nfoCw.ogg"},{"description":"CH0144_ExWeapon_Get","category":"growup","text":"RABBIT-26式重机枪，收到。……嗯，沉甸甸的就是好，舒服。","text_original":"RABBIT26式機関銃、確かに受け取った。……うん。やはりこの重さ、安心する。","file":"//static.kivo.wiki/voices/students/%E7%A9%BA%E4%BA%95%20%E5%92%B2/Tjiv94ST5an4NfkXteFVvbf4OZtU0VvU.ogg"},{"description":"CH0144_Formation_In_1","category":"formation","text":"已经准备好了！","text_original":"準備ならもうできてる。","file":"//static.kivo.wiki/voices/students/%E7%A9%BA%E4%BA%95%20%E5%92%B2/3aaPzzBpx7cPjKxEeI2pHrWroHtvrGhW.ogg"},{"description":"CH0144_Formation_In_2","category":"formation","text":"部署完成，准备完毕。","text_original":"配置についた、準備完了。","file":"//static.kivo.wiki/voices/students/%E7%A9%BA%E4%BA%95%20%E5%92%B2/wguSoZhYxwoET4a1z5fX4tRn6SXVMGTg.ogg"},{"description":"CH0144_Gachaget","category":"growup","text":"SRT特种学院，RABBIT小队所属，空井咲前来报到。那，沙勒的作战手册上哪儿领？","text_original":"SRT特殊学園、RABBIT小隊の空井サキだ。で、シャーレの教範はどこにある？","file":"//static.kivo.wiki/voices/students/%E7%A9%BA%E4%BA%95%20%E5%92%B2/XO8j75SAPVysUQxnrGJT6kmlPsrfevfe.ogg"},{"description":"CH0144_Growup_1","category":"growup","text":"这都是坚持训练的成果。","text_original":"これもたゆまぬ訓練の成果だ。","file":"//static.kivo.wiki/voices/students/%E7%A9%BA%E4%BA%95%20%E5%92%B2/mywHg7bvrB5u2p73hKsT8TiICOxZOSZS.ogg"},{"description":"CH0144_Growup_2","category":"growup","text":"想要变强，就必须仔细阅读作战教学手册。","text_original":"強くなりたいなら、地道に教範を読むことだな。","file":"//static.kivo.wiki/voices/students/%E7%A9%BA%E4%BA%95%20%E5%92%B2/DFIutcEQIr1o5MzDCNv4ShNKjsIVUPCn.ogg"},{"description":"CH0144_Growup_3","category":"growup","text":"虽然很不服气，不过老师的指导，确实有用。","text_original":"悔しいが、やはり先生の教えはためになる。","file":"//static.kivo.wiki/voices/students/%E7%A9%BA%E4%BA%95%20%E5%92%B2/zS5pl2cEE3TwA1fWqN4KwqzJLrfuF7CW.ogg"},{"description":"CH0144_Growup_4","category":"growup","text":"为了追上前辈们的步伐，必须变得更强！","text_original":"先輩たちに追いつくために、もっともっと強くならないと。","file":"//static.kivo.wiki/voices/students/%E7%A9%BA%E4%BA%95%20%E5%92%B2/wzkwsr3zilGzinj8VNsalV5CeTRejCxG.ogg"},{"description":"CH0144_Lobby_1","category":"lobby","text":"……有时间开玩笑，不如专心工作。","text_original":"……ふざけてる暇があったら、仕事に集中しろ。","file":"//static.kivo.wiki/voices/students/%E7%A9%BA%E4%BA%95%20%E5%92%B2/igLlXw8TkStHvJR83hQHwVYtRq8lSJYG.ogg"},{"description":"CH0144_Lobby_2_1","category":"lobby","text":"老话说得好，枪如挚友。 只要好好照料它，它就不会背叛你。","text_original":"良く言うだろう、銃器は良い友人と一緒。きちんと向き合えば、裏切る事は無いって。","file":"//static.kivo.wiki/voices/students/%E7%A9%BA%E4%BA%95%20%E5%92%B2/xmUA5ClUZcee6FlEL1uO3zZ3IxW80xrg.ogg"},{"description":"CH0144_Lobby_2_2","category":"lobby","text":"只有懒鬼的装备才会出故障。","text_original":"機器の故障なんてのが起きるのは、怠け者の証拠だ。","file":"//static.kivo.wiki/voices/students/%E7%A9%BA%E4%BA%95%20%E5%92%B2/1T0rhQ5PFkmEWhHxsDmZdTx9ykZOKWzu.ogg"},{"description":"CH0144_Lobby_3_1","category":"lobby","text":"教学手册还是纸质的有感觉啊。","text_original":"やはり教範は紙に限る。","file":"//static.kivo.wiki/voices/students/%E7%A9%BA%E4%BA%95%20%E5%92%B2/rzyHXNmDP4i1qopHluIsVOAOLj6PpciH.ogg"},{"description":"CH0144_Lobby_3_2","category":"lobby","text":"既不用担心没电，也不用担心黑客入侵……","text_original":"充電の必要も無ければ、ハッキングの心配も無いからな。","file":"//static.kivo.wiki/voices/students/%E7%A9%BA%E4%BA%95%20%E5%92%B2/lCtBk5hBC33QekDD9Hnf5zXYRc3UO9nI.ogg"},{"description":"CH0144_Lobby_4","category":"lobby","text":"……我说不行就是不行。怎么能在作战中脱下钢盔呢。","text_original":"……ダメと言ったらダメだ。作戦中に鉄帽を外す奴がいるか。","file":"//static.kivo.wiki/voices/students/%E7%A9%BA%E4%BA%95%20%E5%92%B2/4KaElvBYT3DNlY1AvMNW4IPIfkVOzjqu.ogg"},{"description":"CH0144_Lobby_5_1","category":"lobby","text":"换成前辈们，这么简单的值日工作应该早就完成了吧……","text_original":"先輩たちならこんな当番くらい、もっとスピーディにこなせてたはず……","file":"//static.kivo.wiki/voices/students/%E7%A9%BA%E4%BA%95%20%E5%92%B2/EbOJ11pMNGoqvGAWFp0mIQ96axuJ5ksH.ogg"},{"description":"CH0144_Lobby_5_2","category":"lobby","text":"有时候，我真气自己不够成熟……","text_original":"時々、自分の未熟さが情けなくなるな……","file":"//static.kivo.wiki/voices/students/%E7%A9%BA%E4%BA%95%20%E5%92%B2/7WNuECqkovyYg6rcfRCS1f0ONCB58E1v.ogg"},{"description":"CH0144_Lobby_6","category":"lobby","text":"不，不是！只是因为作战碰到点问题，暂时脱掉一会儿而已！","text_original":"ち、違う！これは作戦上の問題で……一時的に外してるだけだっての！","file":"//static.kivo.wiki/voices/students/%E7%A9%BA%E4%BA%95%20%E5%92%B2/YIJzmk0e5F6fUBqRA9W7Zlk3aBTTVsn6.ogg"},{"description":"CH0144_LogIn_1","category":"lobby","text":"……嗐，是老师啊。 干嘛鬼鬼祟祟的，我差点开火了。","text_original":"……ああ、先生だったか。何だか怪しい奴がいると思って、危うく撃つところだった。","file":"//static.kivo.wiki/voices/students/%E7%A9%BA%E4%BA%95%20%E5%92%B2/3UNATf9mALA06Xc4dEhUnak0sgrsXWZ7.ogg"},{"description":"CH0144_LogIn_2","category":"lobby","text":"……你迟到了。作战中每分每秒都可能左右生死，难道你忘了吗？","text_original":"……遅い。作戦中の1分1秒は命取り、もう忘れたのか？","file":"//static.kivo.wiki/voices/students/%E7%A9%BA%E4%BA%95%20%E5%92%B2/JtUhRijOzocGHmN1gqtnGrUjXttxIYDz.ogg"},{"description":"CH0144_MemorialLobby_1_1","category":"lobby","text":"","text_original":"んっ、くぅっ……！","file":"//static.kivo.wiki/voices/students/%E7%A9%BA%E4%BA%95%20%E5%92%B2/bOEqEOVHm2m5m2Zk1G7HQ2tF028sWvAG.ogg"},{"description":"CH0144_MemorialLobby_1_2","category":"lobby","text":"……啧。里面是不是太紧了，完全拧不开。","text_original":"……ちっ。中が詰まってるのか、全然抜けない。","file":"//static.kivo.wiki/voices/students/%E7%A9%BA%E4%BA%95%20%E5%92%B2/t5a4CNOgHclqx9rCbUAwCi2abwAliV5A.ogg"},{"description":"CH0144_MemorialLobby_2_1","category":"lobby","text":"必须想办法润滑一下……","text_original":"もっと、滑りを良くしないと……。","file":"//static.kivo.wiki/voices/students/%E7%A9%BA%E4%BA%95%20%E5%92%B2/8g65Cka52wVUbOKofS3demQNn92ISc5K.ogg"},{"description":"CH0144_MemorialLobby_2_2","category":"lobby","text":"老师，那边的润滑油能递给我一下吗？","text_original":"先生、そこにある潤滑油をこっちの方にくれるか？","file":"//static.kivo.wiki/voices/students/%E7%A9%BA%E4%BA%95%20%E5%92%B2/TpZxlIZ7pddb3O3Gy4sONX1Kr27chsXW.ogg"},{"description":"CH0144_MemorialLobby_3","category":"lobby","text":"嗯，好多了好多了。","text_original":"おっ、これならいけるんじゃ……？","file":"//static.kivo.wiki/voices/students/%E7%A9%BA%E4%BA%95%20%E5%92%B2/ZE8kbDKrbvEIH9EiGRUGu3x7wsdwuqoE.ogg"},{"description":"CH0144_MemorialLobby_4","category":"lobby","text":"哈啊……清铁锈的时候真是最开心了……","text_original":"あぁ……こうして錆をはがしてる瞬間は、本当に気持ち良い……","file":"//static.kivo.wiki/voices/students/%E7%A9%BA%E4%BA%95%20%E5%92%B2/CXoHSWi35FnMfVg1dSdMv9tzqdRdUNE2.ogg"},{"description":"CH0144_MemorialLobby_5_1","category":"lobby","text":"什么？我手上的动作让你有点无法直视？","text_original":"……何だか手つきが気になって、ちょっと直視できない？","file":"//static.kivo.wiki/voices/students/%E7%A9%BA%E4%BA%95%20%E5%92%B2/iEb5wHYGud5BxsDQSoo3gX2FfiWC47Dr.ogg"},{"description":"CH0144_MemorialLobby_5_2","category":"lobby","text":"呃，啊？！这明明是神圣的炮口维护工作！胡说什么呢？你这蠢货！","text_original":"っ、はぁぁっ！？これは神聖な手入れの作業だぞ！何言ってんだバカ！？","file":"//static.kivo.wiki/voices/students/%E7%A9%BA%E4%BA%95%20%E5%92%B2/Wa4qaNya612fMMEyA5l5vqZeGyXoqkMs.ogg"},{"description":"CH0144_Relationship_Up_1","category":"growup","text":"如果是老师的命令，我一定服从。因为我相信你。","text_original":"先生の命令なら従う、信じてるからな。","file":"//static.kivo.wiki/voices/students/%E7%A9%BA%E4%BA%95%20%E5%92%B2/quO4TFB11HFQ5dkmm9Wfvc4JlawbooWg.ogg"},{"description":"CH0144_Relationship_Up_2","category":"growup","text":"为了加深与指挥官的默契而交流……好吧，如果是这样的话，那就没办法了。","text_original":"指揮官との結束を育むための交流。まあ、それなら仕方ない。","file":"//static.kivo.wiki/voices/students/%E7%A9%BA%E4%BA%95%20%E5%92%B2/t7t7JhDMkDpFU2nqcuho2kT3TRj40bQ7.ogg"},{"description":"CH0144_Relationship_Up_3","category":"growup","text":"老师，偶尔也可以依靠我们一下的。","text_original":"先生。たまには、私たちのことを頼っても良いんだぞ？","file":"//static.kivo.wiki/voices/students/%E7%A9%BA%E4%BA%95%20%E5%92%B2/fNnfQIDTQ3Z10T9SPoUchDcg63dLpO8o.ogg"},{"description":"CH0144_Relationship_Up_4","category":"growup","text":"把后背交给老师，我绝对放心！","text_original":"先生になら、安心して背中を預けられる。","file":"//static.kivo.wiki/voices/students/%E7%A9%BA%E4%BA%95%20%E5%92%B2/8ItrqaRL8eBqOeygSMmQWXWnDDhPrQg7.ogg"},{"description":"CH0144_Season_Birthday","category":"lobby","text":"……啊，我的生日啊。你还记得啊。 老师，谢谢你。","text_original":"……あぁ。誕生日、覚えててくれたのか。ありがとう、先生。","file":"//static.kivo.wiki/voices/students/%E7%A9%BA%E4%BA%95%20%E5%92%B2/CO81oeoyEIQnd2QKi6pC9m8VWzf4Gcw3.ogg"},{"description":"CH0144_Season_Birthday_2","category":"lobby","text":"要是不经常看手册，我有时候自己都会忘……","text_original":"自分でも手帳とかで確認しない限り、よく忘れるんだよな……","file":"//static.kivo.wiki/voices/students/%E7%A9%BA%E4%BA%95%20%E5%92%B2/RlJmGAOdjMKkwTnxgaB5y5clyxy18bVf.ogg"},{"description":"CH0144_Season_Birthday_Player_1","category":"lobby","text":"老师，生日快乐。你想要什么生日礼物啊？","text_original":"誕生日おめでとう、先生。 それで、何か欲しいものは？","file":"//static.kivo.wiki/voices/students/%E7%A9%BA%E4%BA%95%20%E5%92%B2/vEkfJGT6dpHPYEdsCYYQit99Urm8hlpV.ogg"},{"description":"CH0144_Season_Birthday_Player_2","category":"lobby","text":"呃……我的钢盔？！现在戴的这个？","text_original":"……え、私の鉄帽！？ 今被ってるこれ！？","file":"//static.kivo.wiki/voices/students/%E7%A9%BA%E4%BA%95%20%E5%92%B2/35bmEJnHMTnhcB72cO7DDo6ZITYXyerb.ogg"},{"description":"CH0144_Season_Birthday_Player_3","category":"lobby","text":"不，不行，就算是命令也不行……！","text_original":"そ、それはいくら、 先生の命令でも……！？","file":"//static.kivo.wiki/voices/students/%E7%A9%BA%E4%BA%95%20%E5%92%B2/fLLVLj2BeeqEkNtc3UPDbgcF3Y1tNNxn.ogg"},{"description":"CH0144_Season_Halloween_1","category":"lobby","text":"老师，你怎么戴着这么丑的面具，从哪儿弄来的？","text_original":"……先生、そのひどい偽装は誰から貰ったんだ？","file":"//static.kivo.wiki/voices/students/%E7%A9%BA%E4%BA%95%20%E5%92%B2/kfCH25dnOLoweEqOU5lHNkDePyGHx3jc.ogg"},{"description":"CH0144_Season_Halloween_2","category":"lobby","text":"……万圣节cosplay？那是什么？","text_original":"ハロウィーンの、仮装……？何だそれ？","file":"//static.kivo.wiki/voices/students/%E7%A9%BA%E4%BA%95%20%E5%92%B2/o2E7oZEfgQjDQhAnYUSHQgtVPZw4rmSB.ogg"},{"description":"CH0144_Season_NewYear","category":"lobby","text":"如果今年能回到SRT特种学院……","text_original":"今年は、SRTに戻れたら良いけど……","file":"//static.kivo.wiki/voices/students/%E7%A9%BA%E4%BA%95%20%E5%92%B2/aXpUDjnURs9P1E8wL2SDsLJZ9QPKB4iA.ogg"},{"description":"CH0144_Season_Xmas","category":"lobby","text":"圣诞节啊……越是像这种大多数人都会掉以轻心的日子，越得加倍提高警惕。","text_original":"クリスマス……こうやって多くの人が油断する時こそ、徹底的に警戒しないと。","file":"//static.kivo.wiki/voices/students/%E7%A9%BA%E4%BA%95%20%E5%92%B2/LWM0GYEjhYdMwRWGZSsc8MMIsAItjHwc.ogg"}],"voice_cn":[{"description":"ch0144_exskill_2","category":"battle","text":"安全带，准备完毕。","text_original":"","file":"//static.kivo.wiki/voices/students/%E7%A9%BA%E4%BA%95%20%E5%92%B2/HJOlknu6NzYxVVcDV8qSbgHtKDJtAncS.ogg"},{"description":"ch0144_exskill_3","category":"battle","text":"RABBIT 2，已到达现场。","text_original":"","file":"//static.kivo.wiki/voices/students/%E7%A9%BA%E4%BA%95%20%E5%92%B2/3UBz6QqYAWT7YMYcAZg037OYgr7cgK2o.ogg"},{"description":"ch0144_exskill_level_1","category":"battle","text":"开始掩护射击！","text_original":"","file":"//static.kivo.wiki/voices/students/%E7%A9%BA%E4%BA%95%20%E5%92%B2/3AuFWj1zfQLyFIZK6EmJ4TsvYNrhVSXW.ogg"},{"description":"ch0144_exskill_level_2","category":"battle","text":"开始火力支援。","text_original":"","file":"//static.kivo.wiki/voices/students/%E7%A9%BA%E4%BA%95%20%E5%92%B2/G5hYJWLK0FV0jxguGiVmogBiF9RXkifg.ogg"},{"description":"ch0144_exskill_level_3","category":"battle","text":"不要小瞧SRT的力量。","text_original":"","file":"//static.kivo.wiki/voices/students/%E7%A9%BA%E4%BA%95%20%E5%92%B2/obH9WuZPb7f7GUPvg4I7nyTU6arAfX2X.ogg"},{"description":"ch0144_exweapon_get","category":"growup","text":"RABBIT-26式重机枪，收到。……嗯，沉甸甸的就是好，舒服。","text_original":"","file":"//static.kivo.wiki/voices/students/%E7%A9%BA%E4%BA%95%20%E5%92%B2/LrGZRHHy2HlF7458n3voEu4IpoEzGFw1.ogg"},{"description":"ch0144_formation_in_1","category":"formation","text":"已经准备好了！","text_original":"","file":"//static.kivo.wiki/voices/students/%E7%A9%BA%E4%BA%95%20%E5%92%B2/lrHFo1YNK5dVOImOon8f3w73pPo4BiS0.ogg"},{"description":"ch0144_formation_in_2","category":"formation","text":"部署完成，准备完毕。","text_original":"","file":"//static.kivo.wiki/voices/students/%E7%A9%BA%E4%BA%95%20%E5%92%B2/EXqSbz7CqzTMzGLXCH2Nb6y6Q2gPv2ey.ogg"},{"description":"ch0144_gachaget","category":"growup","text":"SRT特种学院，RABBIT小队所属，空井咲前来报到。那，沙勒的作战手册上哪儿领？","text_original":"","file":"//static.kivo.wiki/voices/students/%E7%A9%BA%E4%BA%95%20%E5%92%B2/3Y6z53LGGeaHHvp3zgZCFizcGELUbcmh.ogg"},{"description":"ch0144_growup_1","category":"growup","text":"这都是坚持训练的成果。","text_original":"","file":"//static.kivo.wiki/voices/students/%E7%A9%BA%E4%BA%95%20%E5%92%B2/Sp7O1iVVyxaLPBS2OyZEIc4uRp8xD1OZ.ogg"},{"description":"ch0144_growup_2","category":"growup","text":"想要变强，就必须仔细阅读作战教学手册。","text_original":"","file":"//static.kivo.wiki/voices/students/%E7%A9%BA%E4%BA%95%20%E5%92%B2/dumLrmYJD32LW3Q2vIVka6isi978k4mz.ogg"},{"description":"ch0144_growup_3","category":"growup","text":"虽然很不服气，不过老师的指导，确实有用。","text_original":"","file":"//static.kivo.wiki/voices/students/%E7%A9%BA%E4%BA%95%20%E5%92%B2/DNLb1uEg0HNu9e2orCT1GpBrg2cjeyzu.ogg"},{"description":"ch0144_growup_4","category":"growup","text":"为了追上前辈们的步伐，必须变得更强！","text_original":"","file":"//static.kivo.wiki/voices/students/%E7%A9%BA%E4%BA%95%20%E5%92%B2/OZW2LuR7BWfsvJYygvMlad4zqkV8ltGi.ogg"},{"description":"ch0144_lobby_1","category":"lobby","text":"……有时间开玩笑，不如专心工作。","text_original":"","file":"//static.kivo.wiki/voices/students/%E7%A9%BA%E4%BA%95%20%E5%92%B2/Jwk95JxAjf1R0W7y2sggz3Nas3cf7Hww.ogg"},{"description":"ch0144_lobby_2_1","category":"lobby","text":"老话说得好，枪如挚友。 只要好好照料它，它就不会背叛你。","text_original":"","file":"//static.kivo.wiki/voices/students/%E7%A9%BA%E4%BA%95%20%E5%92%B2/2hzYkg6FyEFqRCzv9s8DQmHk6v6O9eaI.ogg"},{"description":"ch0144_lobby_2_2","category":"lobby","text":"只有懒鬼的装备才会出故障。","text_original":"","file":"//static.kivo.wiki/voices/students/%E7%A9%BA%E4%BA%95%20%E5%92%B2/zWJJFcBd4tw0k2ZrILYy53doUTKmcbrB.ogg"},{"description":"ch0144_lobby_3_1","category":"lobby","text":"教学手册还是纸质的有感觉啊。","text_original":"","file":"//static.kivo.wiki/voices/students/%E7%A9%BA%E4%BA%95%20%E5%92%B2/9itwJ83aXtzVovmDYRK7Xcfwd8FBqhVU.ogg"},{"description":"ch0144_lobby_3_2","category":"lobby","text":"既不用担心没电，也不用担心黑客入侵……","text_original":"","file":"//static.kivo.wiki/voices/students/%E7%A9%BA%E4%BA%95%20%E5%92%B2/KTJLphrmOnIKPR20LUtOBrWnuTwDVwnr.ogg"},{"description":"ch0144_lobby_4","category":"lobby","text":"……我说不行就是不行。怎么能在作战中脱下钢盔呢。","text_original":"","file":"//static.kivo.wiki/voices/students/%E7%A9%BA%E4%BA%95%20%E5%92%B2/4BXPy5w80XE8XxElMnTVxhAX1R3HI5t5.ogg"},{"description":"ch0144_lobby_5_1","category":"lobby","text":"换成前辈们，这么简单的值日工作应该早就完成了吧……","text_original":"","file":"//static.kivo.wiki/voices/students/%E7%A9%BA%E4%BA%95%20%E5%92%B2/XwLslggL9TEvRyM3dUJDmOrUVVSOUKcS.ogg"},{"description":"ch0144_lobby_5_2","category":"lobby","text":"有时候，我真气自己不够成熟……","text_original":"","file":"//static.kivo.wiki/voices/students/%E7%A9%BA%E4%BA%95%20%E5%92%B2/NiAuqlPazRUuNY8xSFY3d48ZxG3P99uz.ogg"},{"description":"ch0144_lobby_6","category":"lobby","text":"不，不是！只是因为作战碰到点问题，暂时脱掉一会儿而已！","text_original":"","file":"//static.kivo.wiki/voices/students/%E7%A9%BA%E4%BA%95%20%E5%92%B2/ufqGmjFP4Bx2plglLtyRQ9kIdodQ728L.ogg"},{"description":"ch0144_login_1","category":"lobby","text":"……嗐，是老师啊。 干嘛鬼鬼祟祟的，我差点开火了。","text_original":"","file":"//static.kivo.wiki/voices/students/%E7%A9%BA%E4%BA%95%20%E5%92%B2/f3zqaU7mfM1ANRFT5cFEMECcSaXCXg71.ogg"},{"description":"ch0144_login_2","category":"lobby","text":"……你迟到了。作战中每分每秒都可能左右生死，难道你忘了吗？","text_original":"","file":"//static.kivo.wiki/voices/students/%E7%A9%BA%E4%BA%95%20%E5%92%B2/L05mwKX2tme7dIr609Q2gb08mj8WcMRx.ogg"},{"description":"ch0144_memoriallobby_1_1","category":"lobby","text":"","text_original":"","file":"//static.kivo.wiki/voices/students/%E7%A9%BA%E4%BA%95%20%E5%92%B2/3u8IAr7JJ6bVHgUO3ImxezMBDY0gf7bc.ogg"},{"description":"ch0144_memoriallobby_1_2","category":"lobby","text":"……啧。里面是不是太紧了，完全拧不开。","text_original":"","file":"//static.kivo.wiki/voices/students/%E7%A9%BA%E4%BA%95%20%E5%92%B2/mpwQiTPxJoAaNSI3as5tfvotNC55xP6q.ogg"},{"description":"ch0144_memoriallobby_2_1","category":"lobby","text":"必须想办法润滑一下……","text_original":"","file":"//static.kivo.wiki/voices/students/%E7%A9%BA%E4%BA%95%20%E5%92%B2/Zpra3xVn9h6h8lvDDRPdIuikDHmuDmMf.ogg"},{"description":"ch0144_memoriallobby_2_2","category":"lobby","text":"老师，那边的润滑油能递给我一下吗？","text_original":"","file":"//static.kivo.wiki/voices/students/%E7%A9%BA%E4%BA%95%20%E5%92%B2/jYCQc4zGDkGUYUTYN027fLWqtJFIrNtX.ogg"},{"description":"ch0144_memoriallobby_3","category":"lobby","text":"嗯，好多了好多了。","text_original":"","file":"//static.kivo.wiki/voices/students/%E7%A9%BA%E4%BA%95%20%E5%92%B2/pGpwf86uA3naSJMFT0Y5KwAaCYs5se72.ogg"},{"description":"ch0144_memoriallobby_4","category":"lobby","text":"哈啊……清铁锈的时候真是最开心了……","text_original":"","file":"//static.kivo.wiki/voices/students/%E7%A9%BA%E4%BA%95%20%E5%92%B2/taXpYUWHb2fOUwwgslMX70RX3pIRGUKS.ogg"},{"description":"ch0144_memoriallobby_5_1","category":"lobby","text":"什么？我手上的动作让你有点无法直视？","text_original":"","file":"//static.kivo.wiki/voices/students/%E7%A9%BA%E4%BA%95%20%E5%92%B2/7ERHcFaG51I3iwkSrVVdwab4l6I6CNCX.ogg"},{"description":"ch0144_memoriallobby_5_2","category":"lobby","text":"呃，啊？！这明明是神圣的炮口维护工作！胡说什么呢？你这蠢货！","text_original":"","file":"//static.kivo.wiki/voices/students/%E7%A9%BA%E4%BA%95%20%E5%92%B2/95EXsKe28W5s7uqTnonBgPHctL6UTIsl.ogg"},{"description":"ch0144_relationship_up_1","category":"growup","text":"如果是老师的命令，我一定服从。因为我相信你。","text_original":"","file":"//static.kivo.wiki/voices/students/%E7%A9%BA%E4%BA%95%20%E5%92%B2/67hYU0sTO35ipnCCHaLRMznocgIwz4lL.ogg"},{"description":"ch0144_relationship_up_2","category":"growup","text":"为了加深与指挥官的默契而交流……好吧，如果是这样的话，那就没办法了。","text_original":"","file":"//static.kivo.wiki/voices/students/%E7%A9%BA%E4%BA%95%20%E5%92%B2/0d0Y6b775tIeO5csUIJBwqh9vlok6Ott.ogg"},{"description":"ch0144_relationship_up_3","category":"growup","text":"老师，偶尔也可以依靠我们一下的。","text_original":"","file":"//static.kivo.wiki/voices/students/%E7%A9%BA%E4%BA%95%20%E5%92%B2/a1ZdNBGBMD4sOasZ1QEujL9oMoFqxujb.ogg"},{"description":"ch0144_relationship_up_4","category":"growup","text":"把后背交给老师，我绝对放心！","text_original":"","file":"//static.kivo.wiki/voices/students/%E7%A9%BA%E4%BA%95%20%E5%92%B2/Neg1rCHQCteCC79kpiyFMRBjswLPy1Nl.ogg"},{"description":"ch0144_season_birthday","category":"lobby","text":"……啊，我的生日啊。你还记得啊。 老师，谢谢你。","text_original":"","file":"//static.kivo.wiki/voices/students/%E7%A9%BA%E4%BA%95%20%E5%92%B2/ytlLDAfimNxUVeuR631R6fzg91M9mi3z.ogg"},{"description":"ch0144_season_birthday_2","category":"lobby","text":"要是不经常看手册，我有时候自己都会忘……","text_original":"","file":"//static.kivo.wiki/voices/students/%E7%A9%BA%E4%BA%95%20%E5%92%B2/SqO3BqasDUiq40B6NB2GAwQL4IwzlZcr.ogg"},{"description":"ch0144_season_birthday_player_1","category":"lobby","text":"老师，生日快乐。你想要什么生日礼物啊？","text_original":"","file":"//static.kivo.wiki/voices/students/%E7%A9%BA%E4%BA%95%20%E5%92%B2/moXQxukZMz9p8dInfcZy3ICenJwX9oqo.ogg"},{"description":"ch0144_season_birthday_player_2","category":"lobby","text":"呃……我的钢盔？！现在戴的这个？","text_original":"","file":"//static.kivo.wiki/voices/students/%E7%A9%BA%E4%BA%95%20%E5%92%B2/VG5Y3qvFoLRLVtJE1FV9NmAwxmaWawic.ogg"},{"description":"ch0144_season_birthday_player_3","category":"lobby","text":"不，不行，就算是命令也不行……！","text_original":"","file":"//static.kivo.wiki/voices/students/%E7%A9%BA%E4%BA%95%20%E5%92%B2/UwdKZdXr04hc13eEp6kmkI5uSdxPwlFu.ogg"},{"description":"ch0144_season_chinesenewyear","category":"lobby","text":"老师，你听说了吗！为了庆祝新春，那边的跳蚤市场正在搞新春半价促销呢！我们快去吧！","text_original":"","file":"//static.kivo.wiki/voices/students/%E7%A9%BA%E4%BA%95%20%E5%92%B2/pb7bPeBmZNBz8ZNNiUeFsyupJBbyVLDL.ogg"},{"description":"ch0144_season_halloween_1","category":"lobby","text":"老师，你怎么戴着这么丑的面具，从哪儿弄来的？","text_original":"","file":"//static.kivo.wiki/voices/students/%E7%A9%BA%E4%BA%95%20%E5%92%B2/9uJqnyMuT9x9cbOVgL1x5rAITFec78kw.ogg"},{"description":"ch0144_season_halloween_2","category":"lobby","text":"……万圣节cosplay？那是什么？","text_original":"","file":"//static.kivo.wiki/voices/students/%E7%A9%BA%E4%BA%95%20%E5%92%B2/G6og5eALDgewAcMh7p49Sp3QEUwgQ4bu.ogg"},{"description":"ch0144_season_midautumn","category":"lobby","text":"这个是，月饼吗？我们从来没有拿到过这种补给呢。哦~上面还画了个兔子呢！","text_original":"","file":"//static.kivo.wiki/voices/students/%E7%A9%BA%E4%BA%95%20%E5%92%B2/3QceDG6oXgzn99b0uqje65EksLAsBCt3.ogg"},{"description":"ch0144_season_newyear","category":"lobby","text":"如果今年能回到SRT特种学院……","text_original":"","file":"//static.kivo.wiki/voices/students/%E7%A9%BA%E4%BA%95%20%E5%92%B2/FWZ5YznsZ6zF40nW5NRhLq1ipokGboIU.ogg"},{"description":"ch0144_season_xmas","category":"lobby","text":"圣诞节啊……越是像这种大多数人都会掉以轻心的日子，越得加倍提高警惕。","text_original":"","file":"//static.kivo.wiki/voices/students/%E7%A9%BA%E4%BA%95%20%E5%92%B2/meZmkBBOyTd2He1yxirlaZQuZMAufZee.ogg"},{"description":"ch0144_title","category":"lobby","text":"Blue Archive","text_original":"","file":"//static.kivo.wiki/voices/students/%E7%A9%BA%E4%BA%95%20%E5%92%B2/8cMmpnC6Fe660Tm86snL6Sa9DPxSdMQa.ogg"},{"description":"ch0144_cafe_monolog_1","category":"cafe","text":"哈啊，一个个都这么松懈……真是可悲。","text_original":"","file":"//static.kivo.wiki/voices/students/%E7%A9%BA%E4%BA%95%20%E5%92%B2/LhROeyogMNKiiuQScEGzNqciXwkTbCFz.ogg"},{"description":"ch0144_cafe_monolog_2","category":"cafe","text":"到哪儿都能碰见傻子。","text_original":"","file":"//static.kivo.wiki/voices/students/%E7%A9%BA%E4%BA%95%20%E5%92%B2/EQvaetUSnYil6pXHCVCT9Rtq4H7OhgdD.ogg"},{"description":"ch0144_cafe_monolog_3","category":"cafe","text":"就算现在是休息时间，也要保持最起码的纪律……","text_original":"","file":"//static.kivo.wiki/voices/students/%E7%A9%BA%E4%BA%95%20%E5%92%B2/Z7R19XMCcaipVtQxkNC8eWGU6gJyhSUT.ogg"},{"description":"ch0144_cafe_monolog_4","category":"cafe","text":"（这个东西的教学手册在哪里啊……？）","text_original":"","file":"//static.kivo.wiki/voices/students/%E7%A9%BA%E4%BA%95%20%E5%92%B2/Ie3bXrqFwOWY2W0QKXGQX2CkWpQxZvnJ.ogg"},{"description":"ch0144_cafe_monolog_5","category":"cafe","text":"（那是什么。在教学手册上也没看到过啊……）","text_original":"","file":"//static.kivo.wiki/voices/students/%E7%A9%BA%E4%BA%95%20%E5%92%B2/97jUeQ5ZOM6h4B2HMB2TiWBc9GHL2lYO.ogg"},{"description":"ch0144_commonskill","category":"battle","text":"这个会有点痛啊！","text_original":"","file":"//static.kivo.wiki/voices/students/%E7%A9%BA%E4%BA%95%20%E5%92%B2/ADmX1qR80AUHWOMKxci08EF53qtNugjP.ogg"},{"description":"ch0144_exskill_1","category":"battle","text":"RABBIT 2，降落准备完毕。","text_original":"","file":"//static.kivo.wiki/voices/students/%E7%A9%BA%E4%BA%95%20%E5%92%B2/iduNM09evbIHmmCY9Op9lDNhay4quz5K.ogg"}],"voice_kr":[{"description":"CH0144_Title","category":"lobby","text":"","text